{"synopsis":"“Lagi-lagi aku bertemu dengannya di kereta terakhir. Andai saja aku bisa berbicara dengannya!” Yeo-un, seorang mahasiswa yang bekerja hingga larut malam dan naik kereta terakhir setiap malamnya. \n\nIa setiap saat selalu bertemu dengan Shin Haein, seorang wanita yang membawa gitar di sana. \n\nSeolah untaian benang takdir bermain, keduanya terus bertemu dan pada akhirnya menyadari artis favorit mereka sama, musisi indie “Long Afternoon.” Lambat laun, mereka menjadi lebih dekat dan dimulailah kisah ini.","alternative_title":"내 최애는 막차를 탄다","author":"JIXKSEE","artist":"JIXKSEE","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"ca281a14-9274-4eef-baa1-1b67e67565b2","number":"88","chapter":"88","title":"Seseorang Yang Suka Belajar","date":"2026-07-27","released":"2026-07-27"},{"chapter_id":"f998917c-0f89-4a73-bf25-5fad7e40da99","number":"87","chapter":"87","title":"Orang Yang Suka Dessert","date":"2026-07-20","released":"2026-07-20"},{"chapter_id":"6f3e3f30-0070-4dbb-b758-4233a610b605","number":"86","chapter":"86","title":"Seseorang Yang Menikmati Senja Bersamamu","date":"2026-07-13","released":"2026-07-13"},{"chapter_id":"d483010d-52ec-4360-ae70-b4ea787a87ca","number":"85","chapter":"85","title":"Seseorang Yang Menyukai Pengecualian","date":"2026-07-08","released":"2026-07-08"},{"chapter_id":"bbb4cefe-a34e-41f4-b5bf-6645e393fd11","number":"84","chapter":"84","title":"Seseorang Yang Suka Berteduh Di Tempat Yang Teduh","date":"2026-06-29","released":"2026-06-29"},{"chapter_id":"1d05cec3-5129-4fb4-be5b-717f0fc648d0","number":"83","chapter":"83","title":"Seseorang Yang Menyukai Duniamu","date":"2026-06-22","released":"2026-06-22"},{"chapter_id":"a32c2241-4110-42b0-afea-9e574233f8ba","number":"82","chapter":"82","title":"Seseorang Yang Suka Festival Musik","date":"2026-06-15","released":"2026-06-15"},{"chapter_id":"61a1a469-e942-4038-b758-04c52292e413","number":"81","chapter":"81","title":"Seseorang Yang Menyukai Liburan Musim Panas","date":"2026-06-09","released":"2026-06-09"},{"chap